><span begin="00:11.040" end="00:12.570">sunset</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.290" end="00:17.250"><span begin="00:13.290" end="00:13.410">I'll </span><span begin="00:13.410" end="00:13.710">never </span><span begin="00:13.710" end="00:13.950">keep </span><span begin="00:13.950" end="00:14.040">it </span><span begin="00:14.040" end="00:14.400">bottled </span><span begin="00:14.400" end="00:15.060">up </span><span begin="00:15.060" end="00:15.210">and </span><span begin="00:15.210" end="00:15.480">left </span><span begin="00:15.480" end="00:15.660">to </span><span begin="00:15.660" end="00:15.750">the </span><span begin="00:15.750" end="00:16.170">hands </span><span begin="00:16.170" end="00:16.260">of </span><span begin="00:16.260" end="00:16.380">the </span><span begin="00:16.380" end="00:17.250">coroner</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.520" end="00:22.230"><span begin="00:17.520" end="00:17.760">Be </span><span begin="00:17.760" end="00:17.850">a </span><span begin="00:17.850" end="00:18.150">true </span><span begin="00:18.150" end="00:18.510">heart</span><span begin="00:18.510" end="00:18.510">, </span><span begin="00:18.510" end="00:18.630">not </span><span begin="00:18.630" end="00:18.690">a </span><span begin="00:18.690" end="00:19.380">follower</span><span begin="00:19.380" end="00:19.560">, </span><span begin="00:19.560" end="00:20.070">we're </span><span begin="00:20.070" end="00:20.490">not </span><span begin="00:20.490" end="00:21.000">done </span><span begin="00:21.000" end="00:22.080">yet </span><span begin="00:22.080" end="00:22.230">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.230" end="00:24.360"><span begin="00:22.230" end="00:22.290">I </span><span begin="00:22.290" end="00:22.530">see </span><span begin="00:22.530" end="00:22.710">it </span><span begin="00:22.710" end="00:22.800">in </span><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:22.920">your </span><span begin="00:22.920" end="00:23.670">movements </span><span begin="00:23.670" end="00: